<p begin="00:56:30.628" end="00:56:33.728" style="s2">you&#39;ve only got 5 minutes <br />left. What can you possibly do?</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.928" end="00:56:39.928" style="s2">You think you can give me a <br />new proposal in 5 minutes?</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.729" end="00:56:52.229" style="s2">Oh, please. You think a few keystrokes will  </p>
<p begin="00:56:52.229" end="00:56:56.529" style="s2">magically give you a perfect framework? <br />Mr. Knight, here&#39;s our revised proposal.</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.128" end="00:57:05.828" style="s2">Seriously, Galen, who do you think you are? You <br />think you can fix it that fast? Just because you  </p>
<p begin="00:57:05.828" end="00:57:11.529" style="s2">can&#39;t doesn&#39;t mean no one can. I just checked <br />it. The overall framework is still intact,  </p>
<p begin="00:57:12.230" end="00:57:20.130" style="s2">but there are too many bugs. We can&#39;t possibly <br />patch them all in the time we have. Mr. Gray,  </p>
<p begin="00:57:20.130" end="00:57:26.230" style="s2">I don&#39;t see any point in wasting more time either. <br />I&#39;d heard of you. I thought you were good at this.  </p>
<p begin="00:57:27.030" end="00:57:32.930" style="s2">What a disappointment. Mr. Knight, we still have <br />a minute left. You haven&#39;t even looked at our  </p>
<p begin="00:57:32.930" end="00:57:38.830" style="s2">framework, and you&#39;ve already made up your mind. <br />Seems the Knight family is just as disappointed.  </p>
<p begin="00:57:39.830" end="00:57:43.930" style="s2">What did you just say? You worthless <br />hired help. I thought Mr. Knight could  </p>
<p begin="00:57:43.930" end="00:57:47.730" style="s2">be a valuable business partner, but you&#39;ve <br />been a real disappointment, Mr. Knight.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.530" end="00:57:59.330" style="s2">Fine, one last chance. Then you&#39;ll have no excuses <br />when you lose. The framework is flawless this  </p>
<p begin="00:57:59.330" end="00:58:05.230" style="s2">time. Impossible. That framework must have been <br />thrown together overnight. How could you possibly  </p>
<p begin="00:58:05.230" end="00:58:10.930" style="s2">fix that many bugs? She still remembered a lot of <br />the details. She just had to rewrite the fixes.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:11.930" end="00:58:16.430" style="s2">Who do you think you&#39;re fooling? But she was <br />also a top student at MI. You&#39;re in no position  </p>
<p begin="00:58:16.430" end="00:58:23.230" style="s2">to judge her abilities. You&#39;ve corrected every <br />flaw and filled in everything that was missing.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:24.130" end="00:58:28.330" style="s2">You&#39;re better than I expected. Your revised <br />proposal is definitely stronger than pages.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:29.030" end="00:58:32.630" style="s2">So, Mr. Knight, have I earned the <br />right to continue this discussion?</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.430" end="00:58:43.430" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. Why? You and Paige both work for <br />Graytech. Whichever one of you gets the credit,  </p>
<p begin="00:58:44.330" end="00:58:48.830" style="s2">my money still goes to Graytech. [music] As <br />long as the company makes money, so do I.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.530" end="00:58:58.430" style="s2">Your proposal was good, so I gave it another <br />look. That doesn&#39;t mean I&#39;d throw away years  </p>
<p begin="00:58:58.430" end="00:59:01.930" style="s2">of friendship with Paige. That&#39;s <br />why she&#39;s getting my investment.  </p>
<p begin="00:59:04.530" end="00:59:10.330" style="s2">Are you not listening, Gallen? Julian and I have <br />been friends for years. Did you really think one  </p>
<p begin="00:59:10.330" end="00:59:17.131" style="s2">proposal would be enough to beat me? So that&#39;s why <br />you&#39;re turning me down, Mr. Knight. That&#39;s right.  </p>
<p begin="00:59:17.831" end="00:59:24.531" style="s2">You lost, Galen. Get out. Sorry. Looks like we <br />won&#39;t be working together this time. If you never  </p>
<p begin="00:59:24.531" end="00:59:29.231" style="s2">intended to work with me, Mr. Knight, why waste <br />our time? If you were from another company, I&#39;d  </p>
<p begin="00:59:29.231" end="00:59:36.331" style="s2">consider your proposal. Unfortunately, save it. I <br />can accept being beaten by someone better, but I  </p>
<p begin="00:59:36.331" end="00:59:42.931" style="s2">won&#39;t let anyone play me for a fool. You&#39;re going <br />to answer for everything you did today. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.331" end="01:00:04.731" style="s2">What&#39;s this about, Mr. Knight? I have a <br />great deal of respect for your abilities,  </p>
<p begin="01:00:04.731" end="01:00:11.331" style="s2">Mr. Gray. That&#39;s why I agreed to this meeting. <br />But my patience has limits to my face.  </p>
<p begin="01:00:12.331" end="01:00:16.631" style="s2">You&#39;re used to throwing your weight around <br />at the office. Make it nice and loud.  </p>
<p begin="01:00:17.431" end="01:00:24.131" style="s2">I like that idea. Just because Julian and I aren&#39;t <br />friends, you think you can treat us like this?  </p>
<p begin="01:00:24.831" end="01:00:31.731" style="s2">That&#39;s right. Call in a favor of your own <br />if you can. We won&#39;t be doing business ever.  </p>
<p begin="01:00:32.931" end="01:00:38.031" style="s2">This country has laws. You can&#39;t do whatever <br />you want. Laws are for people like you. The  </p>
<p begin="01:00:38.031" end="01:00:43.731" style="s2">Constitution guarantees equal treatment under the <br />law. Even the richest families aren&#39;t above it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.331" end="01:00:51.831" style="s2">Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.631" end="01:01:03.531" style="s2">Is that I thought that bracelet looked familiar. <br />It really is the Sterling family star bracelet.  </p>
<p begin="01:01:04.431" end="01:01:09.731" style="s2">The Sterings, the most powerful family in <br />the world. The dynasty that&#39;s been around  </p>
<p begin="01:01:09.731" end="01:01:16.032" style="s2">for a hundred years. Yes. Their businesses span <br />the globe. Their influence reaches everyone.  </p>
<p begin="01:01:16.032" end="01:01:21.632" style="s2">Keep the Sterings happy these days. How do <br />you know someone in the Sterling family?</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.232" end="01:01:31.532" style="s2">I&#39;ve never heard of the Sterling family. My mentor <br />at MIT gave me this bracelet as a graduation gift.  </p>
<p begin="01:01:32.332" end="01:01:37.332" style="s2">Maybe he&#39;s mistaken. Julian, you must be <br />mistaken. Day labor on construction sites.  </p>
<p begin="01:01:37.332" end="01:01:44.632" style="s2">Anyone in the Sterling family? Are you blind? I <br />know a Sterling family treasure when I see one.</p>
<p begin="01:01:47.732" end="01:01:53.432" style="s2">I&#39;m calling the head of the family right <br />now. Gayla married a thief. You won&#39;t just  </p>
<p begin="01:01:53.432" end="01:01:59.932" style="s2">be finished at Graytech. We&#39;ll be finished in <br />this city. I didn&#39;t steal anything. I swear.  </p>
<p begin="01:02:00.932" end="01:02:01.832" style="s2">Of course, I believe you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.132" end="01:02:10.532" style="s2">You&#39;re interrupting me. This had better be <br />important. My apologies, Mrs. Sterling. I&#39;ve  </p>
<p begin="01:02:10.532" end="01:02:15.932" style="s2">just discovered that someone has stolen a treasure <br />belonging to your family. Who would dare steal  </p>
<p begin="01:02:15.932" end="01:02:22.632" style="s2">from the Sterling family? I&#39;ve detained the thief. <br />I&#39;ll leave it to you to decide what happens next.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.232" end="01:02:33.632" style="s2">Put them on the phone. Hello. I swear I <br />didn&#39;t steal the bracelet. Lla, is that you?  </p>
<p begin="01:02:34.332" end="01:02:41.632" style="s2">Anastasia? You little brat. Did you forget about <br />me? All these years and not one phone call.  </p>
<p begin="01:02:42.632" end="01:02:43.732" style="s2">I didn&#39;t want to bother you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.232" end="01:02:51.932" style="s2">Back when I was doing my PhD at MIT, I saw <br />more potential in you than in any other younger  </p>
<p begin="01:02:51.932" end="01:02:58.432" style="s2">student. You never have to be so formal with me. I <br />didn&#39;t steal the bracelet that you gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.932" end="01:03:04.032" style="s2">Put Julian on the phone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.132" end="01:03:11.832" style="s2">Miss Sterling, this is Julian Knight. <br />There seems to have been a misunder.  </p>
<p begin="01:03:12.632" end="01:03:17.732" style="s2">Since when did the Knight family have the <br />nerve to slander someone I mentored? I  </p>
<p begin="01:03:17.732" end="01:03:21.633" style="s2">gave Leela that star bracelet myself <br />before I went home after graduation.  </p>
<p begin="01:03:22.234" end="01:03:27.134" style="s2">If your family doesn&#39;t believe me, I can <br />fly back right now and tell you in person.  </p>
<p begin="01:03:29.634" end="01:03:34.034" style="s2">It&#39;s a misunderstanding. That&#39;s all it is. <br />There&#39;s no need for the head of the Sterling  </p>
<p begin="01:03:34.034" end="01:03:40.634" style="s2">family to trouble herself over something so <br />minor. As my mentor, I honestly had no idea  </p>
<p begin="01:03:40.634" end="01:03:45.534" style="s2">what family she came from. How did she get <br />that lucky? God, I wish I had her connection.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.134" end="01:03:53.034" style="s2">Apologize and slap myself? Of course not. Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.934" end="01:04:00.934" style="s2">What do you want? Since Laya knows the <br />head of the Sterling family, there&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="01:04:00.934" end="01:04:07.534" style="s2">no reason for me to invest with anyone else. <br />Mr. Gray, I look forward to working with you.  </p>
<p begin="01:04:07.534" end="01:04:10.134" style="s2">Julian, you can&#39;t do this. We&#39;re friends.  </p>
<p begin="01:04:10.634" end="01:04:16.634" style="s2">That&#39;s all we are, friends. You can&#39;t possibly <br />compete with a connection to the Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.534" end="01:04:29.334" style="s2">Mr. Gray, there&#39;s an urgent matter at the <br />office. Leela, you were up working all night.  </p>
<p begin="01:04:29.334" end="01:04:33.534" style="s2">Let me take you back to the yacht so you can <br />rest. Work comes first. I&#39;ll take the bus back.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.334" end="01:04:43.334" style="s2">Where are you headed? Don&#39;t trouble yourself, Mr. <br />Knight. Let me give you a ride. No, thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.734" end="01:04:52.734" style="s2">Julian, don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re interested in <br />her. How about I help you steal her away?  </p>
<p begin="01:04:53.934" end="01:05:00.034" style="s2">All you have to do is promise me one thing. <br />Pull your investment in Galen. Deal. Deal.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.734" end="01:05:11.134" style="s2">Hello, it&#39;s Julian. Mr. Knight. How did you get <br />my number? It&#39;s a phone number. It wasn&#39;t hard.  </p>
<p begin="01:05:11.134" end="01:05:15.434" style="s2">I&#39;m calling because I have some concerns about the <br />proposal you gave me. We need to discuss them in  </p>
<p begin="01:05:15.434" end="01:05:22.135" style="s2">person. I&#39;ll send you the hotel&#39;s address and my <br />room number. A hotel? Mr. Knight, my husband isn&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="01:05:22.135" end="01:05:26.935" style="s2">home yet. Why don&#39;t I wait for him and then we can <br />both My patience has limit. Pass this up and you  </p>
<p begin="01:05:26.935" end="01:05:34.635" style="s2">won&#39;t get another chance. Fine, but if you don&#39;t <br />land the deal, you hand over every share you own.</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.535" end="01:05:41.635" style="s2">She&#39;s taking the bait. Miss Gray,</p>
<p begin="01:05:47.535" end="01:05:53.735" style="s2">come in. Mr. Knight, you said there was <br />a problem with the proposal. What is it?  </p>
<p begin="01:05:55.335" end="01:05:58.435" style="s2">You really want to discuss <br />business with the door open?</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.535" end="01:06:05.935" style="s2">It&#39;s just a glass of wine. and <br />Laya, don&#39;t leave me drinking alone.  </p>
<p begin="01:06:06.935" end="01:06:14.935" style="s2">I&#39;ll pass on the wine. Let&#39;s get down to business. <br />To you, I&#39;ll go first. You&#39;re here now. Sit down.  </p>
<p begin="01:06:14.935" end="01:06:21.235" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk. Actually, there&#39;s nothing wrong <br />with your proposal. I wanted some time alone  </p>
<p begin="01:06:21.235" end="01:06:30.735" style="s2">with you. You&#39;re a fascinating woman, Laya. You&#39;re <br />wasted on Galen. The husbands can be replaced. The  </p>
<p begin="01:06:30.735" end="01:06:36.235" style="s2">Knight family can give you things. Gale, you <br />landed the Night family&#39;s investment. Let&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="01:06:36.235" end="01:06:43.335" style="s2">go out for a nice dinner and celebrate. Leela&#39;s <br />resting at home. I&#39;m going back to be with her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.035" end="01:06:53.735" style="s2">Gale, you&#39;re still thinking about that wife of <br />yours. The Knight family has already agreed to  </p>
<p begin="01:06:53.735" end="01:06:59.535" style="s2">invest in me. I have something to show <br />you. in a hotel room with another man.</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.135" end="01:07:10.635" style="s2">Is it true the wife of Grey Tech CEO worked <br />manual jobs before marrying her way to the top?  </p>
<p begin="01:07:12.935" end="01:07:19.935" style="s2">We also hear she&#39;s in there. Mr. Gray, are you <br />here to ask for a divorce? Stop making things up.  </p>
<p begin="01:07:21.135" end="01:07:22.536" style="s2">You can be sued for spreading lies.</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.537" end="01:07:32.637" style="s2">You&#39;re a gray, too. What do you gain? You really <br />have no shame. Leela isn&#39;t that kind of person.  </p>
<p begin="01:07:33.537" end="01:07:39.937" style="s2">I trust her. Gail, don&#39;t open it. The press <br />is right here. What if I choose to trust her?</p>
<p begin="01:07:45.837" end="01:07:52.037" style="s2">Galen, what are you doing here? That&#39;s a <br />disgusting stunt to pull, Mr. Knight. I  </p>
<p begin="01:07:52.037" end="01:07:55.837" style="s2">have no idea what you&#39;re talking about. Laya <br />and I were just discussing her proposal.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.136" end="01:08:03.436" style="s2">You&#39;re not drunk? Of course not. <br />Something felt wrong the second  </p>
<p begin="01:08:03.437" end="01:08:07.137" style="s2">I got to the in a place like <br />that after he drugged the wine.</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.236" end="01:08:21.136" style="s2">It didn&#39;t work. He took her away. <br />Glenn, all of a sudden, I feel so hot.  </p>
<p begin="01:08:22.836" end="01:08:29.836" style="s2">Leela, Leela, what&#39;s wrong? The press is <br />already all over this. If anything else happens,  </p>
<p begin="01:08:29.836" end="01:08:34.536" style="s2">it could damage Gray Techch&#39;s reputation. <br />You&#39;re worried about the company now?</p>
<p begin="01:08:37.637" end="01:08:38.637" style="s2">[panting]  </p>
<p begin="01:08:38.637" end="01:08:45.537" style="s2">Don&#39;t go. I&#39;m just getting you a cold towel. Do <br />you have feelings for me? Then will you help me?  </p>
<p begin="01:08:46.637" end="01:08:51.937" style="s2">You&#39;re not thinking clearly. I can&#39;t take <br />advantage of you. I am thinking clearly. I  </p>
<p begin="01:08:51.937" end="01:08:56.837" style="s2">know you&#39;re Galen. You&#39;re my husband, my <br />man. The one I&#39;m going to grow old with.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.836" end="01:09:05.936" style="s2">You&#39;re telling me Gavin got the Knight <br />family&#39;s investment? You worthless little brat?  </p>
<p begin="01:09:08.037" end="01:09:13.637" style="s2">Why are you taking it out on our daughter? She <br />couldn&#39;t even beat some girl who works odd jobs.  </p>
<p begin="01:09:13.637" end="01:09:19.637" style="s2">She deserves it. I&#39;ll beat her to death. Do <br />you have any idea how many strings I&#39;ll have  </p>
<p begin="01:09:19.637" end="01:09:27.738" style="s2">to pull to get out of that bet? Dad, [screaming] <br />help me. Please, it&#39;s done. Beating her to death  </p>
<p begin="01:09:27.738" end="01:09:35.238" style="s2">won&#39;t change anything. Don&#39;t forget, Paige is the <br />only daughter you have. I had another daughter,  </p>
<p begin="01:09:35.938" end="01:09:43.038" style="s2">an older one. I promised my mother on her deathbed <br />that I&#39;d take care of my daughter, but I lost her.  </p>
<p begin="01:09:44.538" end="01:09:51.538" style="s2">She must be all grown up now. Maybe she has a <br />family, a career. I was so careless. It was all  </p>
<p begin="01:09:51.538" end="01:09:57.738" style="s2">my fault. My baby, I&#39;ve never stopped looking <br />for you. Where are you? Where&#39;s my little girl?</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.638" end="01:10:06.538" style="s2">Hello? What? You found my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.938" end="01:10:15.638" style="s2">As far as I&#39;m concerned, you&#39;re still nowhere <br />near X&#39;s league. But what can I do? My brother&#39;s  </p>
<p begin="01:10:15.638" end="01:10:21.738" style="s2">in love with you. That&#39;s fair. Don&#39;t get too <br />comfortable, though. You&#39;re just a standin. Once  </p>
<p begin="01:10:21.738" end="01:10:28.338" style="s2">I meet X, I&#39;ll make sure she&#39;s the one my brother <br />marries. Actually, X might not be as perfect as  </p>
<p begin="01:10:28.338" end="01:10:33.838" style="s2">you think. Maybe she&#39;s worked construction jobs, <br />too. Maybe she&#39;s even fallen for the wrong person.  </p>
<p begin="01:10:33.838" end="01:10:41.938" style="s2">I&#39;m warning you. Don&#39;t insult my idol or you&#39;ll <br />be sorry. Really? Are you sure? [sighs] I never  </p>
<p begin="01:10:41.938" end="01:10:46.038" style="s2">thought I&#39;d actually get to meet my family <br />someday. You mean you found your birth parents?  </p>
<p begin="01:10:46.738" end="01:10:51.238" style="s2">Sister Margaret at the children&#39;s home says we <br />still need a DNA test. So, I have to go over  </p>
<p begin="01:10:51.238" end="01:10:56.438" style="s2">there this afternoon. I&#39;ll come with you. <br />You can&#39;t. We&#39;ve got a board meeting today.  </p>
<p begin="01:10:57.238" end="01:11:05.038" style="s2">Oh, it&#39;s okay. Take care of work. I can go on <br />my own. Why do you turn up everywhere I go?  </p>
<p begin="01:11:05.938" end="01:11:09.838" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing but bad luck. Still trying <br />to worm your way into the Gray family.  </p>
<p begin="01:11:10.838" end="01:11:15.438" style="s2">We&#39;re finally being reunited with our daughter <br />today, and you have to show up and ruin it.  </p>
<p begin="01:11:15.438" end="01:11:20.938" style="s2">Get the hell out. Sister Margaret asked me to <br />come today. You have no right to make me leave.  </p>
<p begin="01:11:20.938" end="01:11:26.438" style="s2">Laya, what are you wearing? It all looks so <br />cheap. I heard you&#39;ve been picking up shifts on  </p>
<p begin="01:11:26.438" end="01:11:32.339" style="s2">construction sites. Beg nicely and maybe I&#39;ll take <br />pity on you and find you a job sweeping streets.  </p>
<p begin="01:11:32.339" end="01:11:37.439" style="s2">Exactly. Oh, right. I think Sister Margaret <br />said the home needs renovating. If you&#39;ve  </p>
<p begin="01:11:37.439" end="01:11:42.039" style="s2">got money to spare, why don&#39;t you pay <br />for it? If the home needs renovating,  </p>
<p begin="01:11:42.040" end="01:11:45.340" style="s2">of course I want to help. I don&#39;t have the <br />money right now, but I can have someone send it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.839" end="01:11:53.239" style="s2">Um, I just found out the children&#39;s home needs <br />renovations. Could you lend me some money?  </p>
<p begin="01:11:54.640" end="01:12:00.439" style="s2">Lend you money? No. Leela, I&#39;m <br />your husband. I&#39;ll give you the  </p>
<p begin="01:12:00.439" end="01:12:04.839" style="s2">money. I&#39;m not lending it to you. <br />Do you understand what I&#39;m saying?  </p>
<p begin="01:12:05.540" end="01:12:10.540" style="s2">Message received, hubby. I promise I <br />won&#39;t make that mistake again. Leela,  </p>
<p begin="01:12:11.540" end="01:12:19.040" style="s2">thank you. Thank you so much. We just received <br />$20 million in your name to renovate the home.</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.739" end="01:12:28.539" style="s2">20 million? I&#39;ve never seen that kind of money <br />in my life. But Laya just does odd jobs on  </p>
<p begin="01:12:28.540" end="01:12:34.440" style="s2">construction sites. Where would she get that kind <br />of money? Look how far you&#39;ve come. I had no idea.  </p>
<p begin="01:12:35.739" end="01:12:40.339" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for you and this home, sister, <br />I might not even be alive today. I want this  </p>
<p begin="01:12:40.339" end="01:12:45.739" style="s2">place to be able to help more children who need <br />it. Every kid out there on the streets deserves  </p>
<p begin="01:12:45.739" end="01:12:51.839" style="s2">a home. Of course. Of course. The test results <br />should be here soon. Just wait here a little  </p>
<p begin="01:12:51.839" end="01:12:58.839" style="s2">longer. Hey, Laya. What&#39;s your secret? How <br />did you get all that money? Seriously, Yla,  </p>
<p begin="01:12:59.439" end="01:13:04.239" style="s2">we all grew up here together. If you know how <br />to get rich, you&#39;ve got to let us in on it.  </p>
<p begin="01:13:05.540" end="01:13:12.940" style="s2">Actually, I Laya gets her money by living <br />off a man. Why do you look so scared?  </p>
<p begin="01:13:13.739" end="01:13:18.939" style="s2">This is a special day for the Gray family. We&#39;re <br />reuniting with our daughter. Why are you hanging  </p>
<p begin="01:13:18.939" end="01:13:24.339" style="s2">around where you&#39;re not wanted? Hoping to <br />claim some connection to us? I&#39;m sick of  </p>
<p begin="01:13:24.339" end="01:13:29.340" style="s2">looking at you. Get out. Sister Margaret asked <br />me to come. You have no right to throw me out.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.141" end="01:13:42.940" style="s2">Mom, have you lost your mind? I finally found <br />you. Leela is the child I lost all those years  </p>
<p begin="01:13:42.940" end="01:13:51.140" style="s2">ago. My own daughter. You&#39;re really my mom. It&#39;s <br />all my fault. I wasn&#39;t careful enough and I lost  </p>
<p begin="01:13:51.141" end="01:13:55.340" style="s2">you. But I&#39;ve been searching for you all these <br />years. And you were right here, right in front  </p>
<p begin="01:13:55.340" end="01:14:00.540" style="s2">of me. This is all my fault. The way I treated <br />you, how could I be so cruel? How could I?  </p>
<p begin="01:14:00.541" end="01:14:08.440" style="s2">What&#39;s going on here, Paige? I warned you. If you <br />ever hurt my wife again, you&#39;ll answer to me. It  </p>
<p begin="01:14:08.440" end="01:14:14.440" style="s2">wasn&#39;t me. Stop making things up. I&#39;m the one who <br />slapped her. I won&#39;t let anyone hurt my daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.041" end="01:14:23.741" style="s2">Ever since I was little, you&#39;ve had this fantasy <br />that I&#39;d marry your missing daughter. [snorts] I  </p>
<p begin="01:14:23.741" end="01:14:28.340" style="s2">kept refusing. So, you started setting <br />me up on dates and arranging matches,  </p>
<p begin="01:14:28.340" end="01:14:34.140" style="s2">trying to get me to agree to marry her. You <br />spent years trying to control me to keep  </p>
<p begin="01:14:34.141" end="01:14:40.141" style="s2">me on a leash. But I&#39;m married now. Whether you <br />found your daughter or not, I&#39;m not marrying her.  </p>
<p begin="01:14:41.541" end="01:14:49.641" style="s2">Actually, you might not want to rule it out <br />quite so firmly. Apparently, I&#39;m the Gray  </p>
<p begin="01:14:49.641" end="01:14:55.941" style="s2">family&#39;s missing daughter. You&#39;re actually <br />So, do you still want to be married to me?  </p>
<p begin="01:14:56.741" end="01:15:02.641" style="s2">Don&#39;t even say that. You went missing before <br />Dorothy adopted me. We&#39;re not related by blood.  </p>
<p begin="01:15:02.641" end="01:15:10.441" style="s2">You&#39;re my wife, and that&#39;s not changing. Laya, <br />I&#39;m so sorry. Could you come stay at the estate  </p>
<p begin="01:15:11.041" end="01:15:19.641" style="s2">for a few days? Gla, that house was left to you <br />by your parents. Now that my daughter&#39;s back,  </p>
<p begin="01:15:19.641" end="01:15:25.641" style="s2">the two of you should move back in. All right. <br />I&#39;m calling a shareholders meeting tomorrow. I  </p>
<p begin="01:15:25.641" end="01:15:29.541" style="s2">have something important to announce. <br />Both of you, make sure you&#39;re there.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.940" end="01:15:35.940" style="s2">[snorts]  </p>
<p begin="01:15:35.940" end="01:15:40.542" style="s2">I can&#39;t believe Yla is the child who went missing. <br />What do we do now? She&#39;s your mother&#39;s daughter,  </p>
<p begin="01:15:40.542" end="01:15:43.642" style="s2">too. What if she tries to take <br />your mother&#39;s shares from you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.142" end="01:15:53.542" style="s2">Well, isn&#39;t this my lucky day? Laya <br />mom shares are mine. All mine. Paige  </p>
<p begin="01:15:53.542" end="01:15:57.942" style="s2">is petty and she never lets anything go. <br />She&#39;s definitely going to come after you.  </p>
<p begin="01:15:59.242" end="01:16:03.142" style="s2">I won&#39;t let you lose to her. Whatever <br />anyone says, you&#39;re the one I want.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.842" end="01:16:10.942" style="s2">Gayen. Laya, you two. Oh my <br />god. I I didn&#39;t see anything.  </p>
<p begin="01:16:12.142" end="01:16:16.942" style="s2">Nate, what did you need? Uh, I <br />forgot. Don&#39;t let me interrupt.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.642" end="01:16:32.942" style="s2">I&#39;ve asked you all here because I have <br />an important announcement. A DNA test has  </p>
<p begin="01:16:32.942" end="01:16:39.942" style="s2">confirmed that Leela Anderson is the daughter my <br />ex-husband and I lost all those years ago. She&#39;s a  </p>
<p begin="01:16:39.942" end="01:16:48.842" style="s2">gray by blood and she&#39;ll also be a shareholder in <br />gray tech. Be quiet. Your father&#39;s ex-wife worked  </p>
<p begin="01:16:48.842" end="01:16:54.742" style="s2">at the hospital. While I was still weak from <br />giving birth, she threw Leela in a dumpster,  </p>
<p begin="01:16:55.242" end="01:16:59.342" style="s2">then brought you in to take her place. <br />[music] I know exactly what happened. Leela,  </p>
<p begin="01:16:59.942" end="01:17:05.042" style="s2">I&#39;d like to throw a party. I want all <br />of San Francisco to know you&#39;re a gray.  </p>
<p begin="01:17:05.842" end="01:17:12.042" style="s2">Those welcome parties are for little children. <br />Laya&#39;s a grown woman. What&#39;s the point of throwing  </p>
<p begin="01:17:12.042" end="01:17:19.242" style="s2">her one now? If everyone finds out, she&#39;ll make <br />us all look bad. Everyone, I have an even more  </p>
<p begin="01:17:19.242" end="01:17:26.742" style="s2">important announcement. I&#39;m transferring <br />every share I own in the company to Leela.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.842" end="01:17:38.543" style="s2">Only Galen has more. And you&#39;re giving <br />it all to some stranger you just found.  </p>
<p begin="01:17:40.143" end="01:17:47.243" style="s2">She&#39;s not a stranger. She&#39;s my daughter. <br />And I owe her more than 20 years of love  </p>
<p begin="01:17:48.043" end="01:17:52.943" style="s2">and care. Not my biological daughter <br />at all. You&#39;re Lawrence&#39;s daughter  </p>
<p begin="01:17:52.943" end="01:18:00.643" style="s2">with his ex-wife all these years. Dad, <br />that&#39;s not true, is it? Say something,  </p>
<p begin="01:18:01.543" end="01:18:07.543" style="s2">Dorothy. How could you say that? Has it been so <br />long you&#39;ve forgotten how this all started? When  </p>
<p begin="01:18:07.543" end="01:18:14.743" style="s2">you married into the Gray family, you brought your <br />daughter with you. My own daughter was missing,  </p>
<p begin="01:18:15.243" end="01:18:23.043" style="s2">so I didn&#39;t object. All these years, you&#39;ve <br />used my money to raise someone else&#39;s child.  </p>
<p begin="01:18:24.943" end="01:18:34.043" style="s2">I let it go. But now, my daughter is back, and <br />you&#39;ve been tormenting her. This ends now. I&#39;m  </p>
<p begin="01:18:34.043" end="01:18:41.043" style="s2">divorcing you right now. You&#39;ll walk away with <br />nothing. I never want to see either of you again.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.943" end="01:18:49.843" style="s2">You can keep living in the house my parents left <br />me. As for the shares, give them to my husband.  </p>
<p begin="01:18:51.043" end="01:18:54.843" style="s2">To me? What? You think you can <br />take my shares and then betray me?  </p>
<p begin="01:18:55.343" end="01:19:02.143" style="s2">I wouldn&#39;t dare. My wife already owns my heart <br />and soul. Let&#39;s keep the shares in her name, too.  </p>
<p begin="01:19:03.843" end="01:19:08.243" style="s2">What am I going to do with <br />you? Fine. Have it your way.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.643" end="01:19:23.743" style="s2">I&#39;m X, the mystery genius on the Nova forum.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.843" end="01:19:29.543" style="s2">I wrote every paper on that forum.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.543" end="01:19:36.543" style="s2">X, the one who publishes all <br />that technical research for  </p>
<p begin="01:19:36.543" end="01:19:40.745" style="s2">free. If Mrs. Gray is X, then our company could.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.645" end="01:19:53.645" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.645" end="01:20:00.045" style="s2">This is my account dashboard on the Nova forum. <br />My account, my papers. When I sent the company my  </p>
<p begin="01:20:00.045" end="01:20:06.545" style="s2">latest paper, I wanted to prove my worth. But <br />then someone decided [music] to hand over her  </p>
<p begin="01:20:06.545" end="01:20:13.945" style="s2">shares to a stranger she just found. I lost all <br />faith in this company. That&#39;s why I withdraw it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.845" end="01:20:22.845" style="s2">Now, [snorts] it should be obvious who <br />deserves to be the second largest shareholder.</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.945" end="01:20:33.745" style="s2">[music] Know your place, Laya. You&#39;re <br />a construction day laborer who got into  </p>
