<p begin="01:20:41.045" end="01:20:46.245" style="s2">technology it needs. If you&#39;re smart, <br />you&#39;ll give up those shares. I couldn&#39;t  </p>
<p begin="01:20:46.245" end="01:20:52.045" style="s2">care less about the shares. But Paige <br />has made Galen suffer long enough. He  </p>
<p begin="01:20:52.045" end="01:20:56.545" style="s2">wants to take back everything that&#39;s his. <br />And for his sake, I&#39;m not backing down.</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.545" end="01:21:10.845" style="s2">far more to the table than <br />an ordinary shareholder.  </p>
<p begin="01:21:10.845" end="01:21:13.945" style="s2">Exactly. Ex&#39;s research has <br />saved several tech companies.  </p>
<p begin="01:21:16.145" end="01:21:21.745" style="s2">They&#39;re both your daughters, but one of <br />them is X, and that makes her far more  </p>
<p begin="01:21:21.745" end="01:21:29.845" style="s2">valuable to the company&#39;s future. Dorothy, <br />think this through. All right, I&#39;ve decided</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.245" end="01:21:41.746" style="s2">Sorry to interrupt, Mrs. Gray. <br />I&#39;ve just learned that someone  </p>
<p begin="01:21:41.746" end="01:21:46.346" style="s2">at Graytech is pretending to be X <br />and using that name to con people.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.346" end="01:22:02.146" style="s2">Tell them I&#39;m X. You&#39;re ex? Then you <br />must know who founded the Nova Forum.</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.946" end="01:22:14.046" style="s2">[snorts] The Nova Forum was founded by <br />Anastasia Sterling, head of the Sterling family.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.146" end="01:22:24.346" style="s2">When she detected a suspicious login <br />on Ex&#39;s account, she immediately reset  </p>
<p begin="01:22:24.346" end="01:22:29.546" style="s2">the password [music] and sent the <br />new one to the real ex&#39;s phone.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.346" end="01:22:44.346" style="s2">Miss Gray, it&#39;s time to drop the act.</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.146" end="01:22:54.246" style="s2">Anastasia Sterling has remotely traced <br />every suspicious login. Over the past week,  </p>
<p begin="01:22:54.246" end="01:22:58.846" style="s2">every IP address used to try to access <br />X&#39;s account other than Leela&#39;s phone  </p>
<p begin="01:22:58.846" end="01:23:00.746" style="s2">has been traced back to your personal computer.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.746" end="01:23:08.746" style="s2">Good morning, everyone. I&#39;m Anastasia <br />Sterling, head of the Sterling family  </p>
<p begin="01:23:08.746" end="01:23:15.446" style="s2">and founder of the Nova Forum. It&#39;s an honor to <br />meet you, Mrs. Sterling. I&#39;m here to make one  </p>
<p begin="01:23:15.446" end="01:23:22.246" style="s2">thing clear. Leela Anderson is ex I&#39;ve known <br />her since she was an underassman at MIT and I  </p>
<p begin="01:23:22.246" end="01:23:28.346" style="s2">couldn&#39;t be prouder of her. Extraordinary. <br />Every paper was written by her. Anastasia,  </p>
<p begin="01:23:29.046" end="01:23:34.346" style="s2">you&#39;re giving me far too much credit. I&#39;ve had <br />a few small successes. Nothing that impressive.  </p>
<p begin="01:23:35.746" end="01:23:41.346" style="s2">You haven&#39;t changed. Still hiding what you can <br />do. That&#39;s how people end up walking all over you.  </p>
<p begin="01:23:41.946" end="01:23:47.347" style="s2">Musta Sterling. Leela is my wife. I&#39;ll protect <br />her. I won&#39;t let anyone push her around.  </p>
<p begin="01:23:47.947" end="01:23:54.947" style="s2">I trust Leela&#39;s judgment. Come visit us in Europe <br />sometime. You&#39;ll be my guests. As for Miss Gray,  </p>
<p begin="01:23:56.047" end="01:24:01.247" style="s2">she stole access to Ex&#39;s account, changed <br />the password, and tried to pass herself  </p>
<p begin="01:24:01.248" end="01:24:06.748" style="s2">off as X. The Sterling family has turned <br />all the evidence over to our legal team.</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.047" end="01:24:19.747" style="s2">I was never trying to hide anything. <br />I just don&#39;t like showing off.</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.947" end="01:24:32.947" style="s2">Losing you is the greatest regret of my life. <br />But today, all I want to say is I&#39;m proud of you.  </p>
<p begin="01:24:34.248" end="01:24:39.748" style="s2">So, you really are ex mom. I just did what <br />I love. I&#39;m formally transferring my entire  </p>
<p begin="01:24:39.748" end="01:24:44.848" style="s2">30% stake to my biological daughter, <br />Llaya Anderson. Effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.147" end="01:24:57.747" style="s2">She is never to set foot in this company again. <br />As for Lawrence Miller&#39;s years of embezzlement,  </p>
<p begin="01:24:58.447" end="01:25:00.547" style="s2">I&#39;m turning the matter over <br />to our legal department.</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.647" end="01:25:11.347" style="s2">I heard X was here. Where? That genius you <br />worship has been right beside you all this time.  </p>
<p begin="01:25:11.347" end="01:25:18.947" style="s2">It&#39;s Leela. Leela is X? No way. I told you before. <br />Ex is just an ordinary person. Nothing special.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.947" end="01:25:30.147" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry for the way I&#39;ve treated you both all <br />these years. And I&#39;ve wronged Laya even more.  </p>
<p begin="01:25:30.147" end="01:25:34.647" style="s2">What&#39;s done is done. Leela&#39;s back <br />with you now. That&#39;s what matters.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.547" end="01:25:41.547" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.547" end="01:25:47.149" style="s2">This is Laya&#39;s first board meeting as our second <br />largest shareholder. She used to do odd jobs on  </p>
<p begin="01:25:47.149" end="01:25:53.849" style="s2">construction sites. Is she really ready for <br />a role like this? Who knows? Being ex is one  </p>
<p begin="01:25:53.849" end="01:26:01.149" style="s2">thing. Running a business is another. Let&#39;s <br />get started. Miss Anderson, since you&#39;re X,  </p>
<p begin="01:26:01.149" end="01:26:05.349" style="s2">why don&#39;t you tell us how we should optimize <br />our new products underlying architecture?</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.449" end="01:26:20.549" style="s2">Miss Anderson, I owe you an <br />apology for doubting you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.449" end="01:26:35.349" style="s2">I had no idea my wife was this impressive.  </p>
<p begin="01:26:36.149" end="01:26:41.749" style="s2">I&#39;ve still got work to do. Mom put <br />her faith in me. I can&#39;t let her down.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.249" end="01:26:56.749" style="s2">Dad, I&#39;ll be back and I&#39;ll make them pay. <br />Everything we lost today, I&#39;ll take back twice  </p>
<p begin="01:26:56.749" end="01:27:05.149" style="s2">over. That&#39;s right. If Galen and Laya think this <br />is enough to beat us, they&#39;re dreaming. Once we  </p>
<p begin="01:27:05.149" end="01:27:11.849" style="s2">get to Europe, we&#39;ll be back on top. Dad, Julian <br />gave us this chance. We can&#39;t let it slip away.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.649" end="01:27:20.949" style="s2">The head of the Sterling family promised me <br />a chance to rise higher in my family. All I  </p>
<p begin="01:27:20.949" end="01:27:26.149" style="s2">have to do is make those two bastards <br />pay so dearly they never recover.</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.849" end="01:27:35.849" style="s2">Leela, I&#39;m so proud of you. That <br />little girl who used to save up  </p>
<p begin="01:27:35.849" end="01:27:40.449" style="s2">meal tickets in our cafeteria has <br />become someone we can all look up to.  </p>
<p begin="01:27:42.149" end="01:27:48.349" style="s2">Without this home and you, Sister Margaret, <br />I might not be alive today. I hope this  </p>
<p begin="01:27:48.349" end="01:27:53.650" style="s2">place can help more kids like me. Give all <br />those children out on the streets a home.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.550" end="01:28:05.850" style="s2">This is my first time seeing X in <br />person. I heard she used to scrape  </p>
<p begin="01:28:05.850" end="01:28:11.650" style="s2">by doing odd jobs. What she&#39;s accomplished <br />is incredible. Absolutely. Ex&#39;s story is  </p>
<p begin="01:28:11.650" end="01:28:16.350" style="s2">the stuff of legends. Galen must be the <br />luckiest man alive to have married her.  </p>
<p begin="01:28:17.250" end="01:28:23.050" style="s2">Thank you all for coming. Today, I&#39;d like to <br />introduce Gratech&#39;s next generation AI system.</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.950" end="01:28:30.750" style="s2">We&#39;re licensing its core architecture to <br />developers worldwide, free of charge. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.050" end="01:28:39.150" style="s2">Grrey is going to build the world&#39;s largest <br />open-source AI community. We have one goal. break  </p>
<p begin="01:28:39.150" end="01:28:44.850" style="s2">the monopoly on computing power and give everyday <br />people equal access to the most advanced AI.</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.350" end="01:28:51.350" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.350" end="01:28:55.350" style="s2">I really misjudged her. I let <br />that kind of talent slip away.  </p>
<p begin="01:28:56.450" end="01:29:00.750" style="s2">You didn&#39;t misjudge her, sir. Laya just <br />keeps a low profile. Who could have  </p>
<p begin="01:29:00.750" end="01:29:05.350" style="s2">guessed a woman working odd jobs was <br />the world&#39;s most elusive tech genius?  </p>
<p begin="01:29:07.650" end="01:29:11.350" style="s2">Sir, it&#39;s done. [music] Just as you <br />asked. Paige and Lawrence were taken  </p>
<p begin="01:29:11.350" end="01:29:15.750" style="s2">straight to the slums when they got off <br />the plane. They&#39;ll never recover from this.</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.250" end="01:29:25.450" style="s2">Thank you all for joining us tonight. I have <br />two announcements. First, I&#39;m officially  </p>
<p begin="01:29:25.450" end="01:29:32.950" style="s2">retiring. Gail Gray will take over as chairman <br />of Grey Tech. [applause] Second, I&#39;m appointing  </p>
<p begin="01:29:32.950" end="01:29:39.050" style="s2">Leela Anderson as Grey Tech&#39;s chief technology <br />officer. She&#39;s my daughter and she&#39;s also ex  </p>
<p begin="01:29:39.050" end="01:29:44.150" style="s2">herself. I believe that under her leadership, <br />Grey Tech will lead the way into a new era.</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.750" end="01:29:54.751" style="s2">The best decision I ever made was asking a girl <br />in Union Square to marry me. That girl pressed  </p>
<p begin="01:29:54.751" end="01:30:00.151" style="s2">this coin into my hand. She said she wanted <br />to share half her luck with me. Right then,  </p>
<p begin="01:30:00.151" end="01:30:05.951" style="s2">I knew she was someone I&#39;d spend my life <br />protecting. I gave you half my luck that  </p>
<p begin="01:30:05.952" end="01:30:11.151" style="s2">day. gave me all of yours. Being your wife is <br />the luckiest thing that&#39;s ever happened to me.  </p>
<p begin="01:30:11.151" end="01:30:16.151" style="s2">No, I&#39;m the lucky one. I got to marry you, <br />Laya. I love you. You&#39;re my whole world.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
